WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,220
The construction guy has a suggestion for you.

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:07,220
Promote safety measures well on the island

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,220
Look, such a thing was born

4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,220
Three days Maximum three days

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,220
I will come to Longmu City to kill you in person

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,540
Your death has come

7
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,540
Then I'm flying back to Kyoto now

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,540
If you can't offend me, you can't afford to hide either.
